Nama saya &lt;NAMA&gt;. Keluarga saya ada 4 <segment id='4' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>orang. <segment id='3' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='4'>Orantua</segment>,</segment> saya, adik <segment id='2' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>perempuan dan</segment> 2 kucing.
<segment id='5' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;pron0' state='active'><segment id='6' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='5'>Orantua</segment> <segment id='7' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active' parent='5'>belerja</segment></segment> di kantor. 

Rumah saya ada di Ehime. Rumah saya berlantai dua. Di rumah ada 3 kamar tidur, <segment id='8' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-nomina;nom0' state='active'>1 mandi</segment>, ruang tamu, ruang makan, <segment id='16' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>dapur dan</segment> <segment id='9' features='eror;leksikal;kata;noms' state='active'>rumah</segment> kucing.
Halaman ada di depan <segment id='10' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>ruma</segment> saya. Di halaman rumah saya ada <segment id='11' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>phon</segment> <segment id='17' features='eror;ejaan;ejtb' state='active'>Kinmokusei, dan</segment> bunga-bunga. <segment id='12' features='eror;gramatikal;frasa-preposisi;prep0' state='active'>Rumah</segment> saya ada banyak bunga karena <segment id='13' features='eror;ejaan;ejk' state='active'>Kakek</segment> saya suka <segment id='14' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>bung</segment>. <segment id='15' features='eror;ejaan;ejhrf' state='active'>Ruma</segment> kakek ada di dekat rumah saya.    </body>
